# Forger

> Forger shows the work on the TYPO3 Core in one place: the issues of forge.typo3.org (Redmine) and the changes of
> review.typo3.org (Gerrit). It imports both every five minutes. Agents read its data through a JSON API that is
> read only and needs no login.

Use the API, not the HTML pages: the pages show the same data, but the API is stable and documented. Each issue and
change has a `url` that leads to the original on Forge or Gerrit. Write to Forge or Gerrit there: Forger only reads.

- Dates are ISO 8601 in UTC, like `2026-11-20T23:40:03Z`. Date filters take `YYYY-MM-DD`.
- A list returns one page and `total`. `limit` is 25 by default and 100 at most, `offset` is where the page starts.
  `offset + limit` may not exceed 10000: narrow the search to read further.
- A failed request returns an object with `error`: 400 for a wrong parameter, 404 for an unknown issue or change,
  429 for too many requests.
- An address may send 120 requests a minute. After a 429, wait the seconds that `Retry-After` gives.
- People are given as `forge:<number>`, `gerrit:<number>` or the username of the TYPO3 account.
- `/api/v1` only gets new fields and parameters. A change that breaks a client gets a new path.

## API

- [OpenAPI document]({{ url('app.api_doc_json') }}): every endpoint, parameter and field, for tools
- [API documentation]({{ url('app.api_doc') }}): the same for people, where they can try the requests
- [List and search issues]({{ url('api_v1_issues') }}): by words, status, tracker, category, tag, person and
  dates; `breakdown=true` also counts them by status, tracker, category, tag and year
- [Get an issue]({{ url('api_v1_issues') }}/{id}): its description, relations and Gerrit changes
- [Find the duplicates of an issue]({{ url('api_v1_issues') }}/{id}/duplicates): the open issues that may describe
  the same
- [List and search changes]({{ url('api_v1_changes') }}): by words, status, branch, review list, file, owner, size
  and dates
- [Get a change]({{ url('api_v1_changes') }}/{number}): its commit message, files, review log and relation chain
- [List the activity]({{ url('api_v1_activity') }}): the events on Forge and Gerrit, the newest first
- [Count the activity]({{ url('api_v1_activity_statistics') }}): figures and series of the events in a time window
- [List the new contributors]({{ url('api_v1_activity_newcomers') }}): who started in a time window and
  where they stand now
- [Count the activity per weekday and hour]({{ url('api_v1_activity_week_hours') }})
- [Count the activity per day of a year]({{ url('api_v1_activity_days') }})
- [Count the reviews between a person and the others]({{ url('api_v1_activity_exchange') }})
- [Count what was closed over the years]({{ url('api_v1_activity_closed_years') }})

